{"unit_id":"T-PageCode__dsh-live-meter#feature-1","repo":"T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter","commit":"b57d355e506f43fff36d3e09546ac498accdc624","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Live Meter 的功能「会话 Token 计量」：读取 DSH 会话事件中的输入、缓存读取和输出 Token，并按会话累计。收到 assistant 消息事件后自动更新，重复轮次会去重，面板显示当前会话与今日合计。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:162-166","lib/meter.js:94-148"]}
{"unit_id":"T-PageCode__dsh-live-meter#feature-2","repo":"T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter","commit":"b57d355e506f43fff36d3e09546ac498accdc624","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Live Meter 的功能「近期用量趋势」：保存每日 Token 与轮次汇总，并提供最近七天的数据。会话事件触发聚合和延迟写盘，打开面板即可查看近期每日趋势。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/meter.js:157-180","lib/index.js:121-127","lib/index.js:268-300"]}
{"unit_id":"T-PageCode__dsh-live-meter#feature-3","repo":"T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter","commit":"b57d355e506f43fff36d3e09546ac498accdc624","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Live Meter 的功能「DeepSeek 余额显示」：从 DSH 的 deepseekAccount 服务读取并解析余额，显示账户可用状态及余额信息。面板请求数据时自动获取；未登录或宿主无该服务时显示不可用状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:204-255","lib/meter.js:249-299"]}
{"unit_id":"T-PageCode__dsh-live-meter#feature-4","repo":"T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter","commit":"b57d355e506f43fff36d3e09546ac498accdc624","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Live Meter 的功能「可调整悬浮面板」：在 DSH 页面注入客户端脚本并创建 Token 计量浮层。用户可拖动、收起或切换紧凑显示，偏好保存在浏览器本地存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:132-148","lib/client.js:11-36","lib/client.js:127-140"]}
