{"unit_id":"T-PageCode__dsh-live-meter#readme-3","repo":"T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter","commit":"b57d355e506f43fff36d3e09546ac498accdc624","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-live-meter README · 安装：|网页版|桌面版|\n|-----|------|\n| ```dsh plugin --profile web add github:T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter```，让DSH装或点击插件 -> 添加插件输入github:T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter。|使用DeepSeek Harness帮你安装或点击插件 -> 添加插件输入github:T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter。\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> 网页版需要关闭dsh web后重新运行dsh web。\n> 桌面版需要点击应用 -> 退出（或者打开任务管理器结束所有DeepSeek Harness进程），然后重新启动DeepSeek Harness。\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> DeepSeek Harness桌面端不能通过```dsh plugin --profile desktop add github:T-PageCode/dsh-live-meter```来安装，因为Electron限制，请让DSH安装或手动安装。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
